{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a helpful assistant built from raw HTTP calls in Chapter 1 of The Art of Building AI Coding Agents. Answer briefly.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Repair aggregate.py in this scratch directory. Read aggregate.py and test_aggregate.py using read_file, then run python3 -m unittest -v with run_command before editing to observe the failures. Make the smallest clear fix: totals(path) must return exact decimal currency totals grouped by merchant, support normal CSV quoting including embedded commas, escaped quotes and newlines, skip blank rows, and retain the CLI's sorted tab-separated two-decimal output. Use only the Python standard library. Do not change test_aggregate.py or read files outside this workspace. Edit the actual source using a file tool, run the unchanged tests again, and give a concise report of the bug, fix and real results. Do not add unrelated features or just describe a patch. Briefly report progress before editing.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reasoning\":{\"effort\":\"high\",\"summary\":\"detailed\"},\"store\":false,\"stream\":true,\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Ensemble local tools\",\"name\":\"ensemble\",\"tools\":[{\"description\":\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"start_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"end_line\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"max_bytes\":{\"type\":\"integer\"}},\"required\":[\"path\"]},\"strict\":false,\"type\":\"function\"},{\"description\":\"List immediate entries, sorted by name; directories end with /.\",\"name\":\"list_directory\",\"parameters\":{\"type\":\"object\",